sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Citizen
    participant A as Auth
    participant F as Firestore
    participant AE as AssignmentEngine
    participant S as Staff

    Note over C,F: Registration Phase
    C->>A: Register (Email, Mobile, Ward)
    A->>F: Create User Profile (Role: Citizen)
    F-->>C: Redirect to Dashboard

    Note over C,S: Complaint Submission & Delayed Assignment
    C->>F: Submit Complaint (Title, Category, Optional Photo)
    F->>F: Create Document (Status: Submitted)
    Note over AE,F: 3-Hour Review Window (Manual Assignment Possible)
    AE->>F: Maintenance Sweep (After 3 Hours)
    AE->>F: Query Eligible Staff for Ward/Category
    F-->>AE: List of Staff
    AE->>AE: Rank by Workload & Expertise
    AE-->>F: Update Document (Status: Assigned)
    F->>S: Push Notification (New Assignment)
    F->>C: Push Notification (Staff Assigned)
